    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d239-f1" n="*" xml:id="d239-f1-content">
                <p>For Senate Ex. Doc. O, Fiftieth Congress (convention for restricting Chinese
                    immigration), see Document No. 260. post, <ref target="#pg396">page 396</ref>
                    (Mr. Bayard to Mr. Chang Yen Hoon, May 8, 1888).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
